On offer
    Say "Sorry, who are you? I'm known as 'The Middle Man', Berret I climb mountains and cross rivers, cross hill and dale, and go wherever I have to to make a little money."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Do you have any Apple of Moradon? Fishing Cork made with Apple of Moradon is the best. My goods aren't affected by the changing seasons and they can sell for a long time. Whenever you get hold of Apple of Moradon, bring it to me. I'll give you the best price for it, no questions asked.\n\nThe best Fishing Cork is made with Wolfman's Claw!! Wolfman's Claw, equals Fishing Cork. Simple! Moradon equals apple, apple equals Moradon! Ha Ha Ha!"

On in_progress
    Say "I sell the best products and make the best profit. Simple as that. I need Apples of Moradon to make the best Fishing Cork."

On claimable
